tick=1
--=f1
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;POP : 10: onImportClicked()
POP-&gt;&gt;&gt;ESW : 11: sendBatch(payload); on=ESW
ESW-&gt;&gt;&gt;API : 12: createBatch(req)  [HTTPS\nPOST\n/api/import-batches,\nbearer token]; on=API
combinedFragment=alt~f2 POP TQ; CSX:[token missing / expired]
API.&gt;ESW : 13: 401 Unauthorized
ESW.&gt;POP : 14: ask student to sign in to CareerPilot
..=f2; CSX:[authenticated]
API-&gt;&gt;&gt;JIS : 15: createBatch(userId,\npayload); on=JIS
